==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>.
*1 [[B.B.Bunny]] spawns after 76.67 seconds<sup>2,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

